values ($pci$chapter-03$pci$, $pci$chapter$pci$, $pci$art-of-being$pci$, $pci$You Were Finished at Birth$pci$, $pci$Intrinsic Completeness and Development$pci$, $pci$canonical$pci$, $pci$approved$pci$, 3, 1)
